# Branch Feature: Running Issues

## Score
- 0

## Intent
Track recurring or notable project issues in a dedicated context file so they can be prioritized and culled over time.

## Directives
- Running issues are tracked in `.harbormaster/.context/RUNNING_ISSUES.md`.
- Add entries only when the user directly asks.
- If an issue appears worth tracking, prompt the user before adding it.
- Each issue entry should include a score.
- Higher issue scores indicate higher cleanup priority.

